// DSL for .mhsc/.mhscp is described in /mnt/shared/metaheuristic.wiki/p/source-code-dsl.md
//
// The YC application-form survey, synthetic: signs in with the YC account in Vault entry VC_YC_AUTH, reads
// the application form at formUrl, and hands back every input field it defines (formFields) and the
// variables { } block of a YC apply flow (applyVariables). It only reads - nothing is written to YC.
//
// 'synthetic' in the name: the survey a DAHF experiment runs to define the apply flow. It is never
// promoted (vc-application/DETAILS.md, part 8).
//
// Launch with mh_create_exec_context_with_variables (source-level inputs, 562.120): formUrl, production null.
// Run it in a company whose Vault - or the management company's, whose keys have priority - holds VC_YC_AUTH.

source "vc-form-survey-yc-synthetic-1.0" {

    def fund = "yc"
    def survey_fn = "mh.asset.vc-form-survey-yc_1.0"

    include "vc-form-survey"
}
